WEBVTT

00:12:29.097 --> 00:12:31.753
ever invented and told by humans,

00:12:31.777 --> 00:12:36.120
because it is the only story
everybody believes.

00:12:36.692 --> 00:12:39.482
Not everybody believes in God,

00:12:39.506 --> 00:12:42.531
not everybody believes in human rights,

00:12:42.555 --> 00:12:45.340
not everybody believes in nationalism,

00:12:45.364 --> 00:12:49.107
but everybody believes in money,
and in the dollar bill.

00:12:49.514 --> 00:12:51.495
Take, even, Osama Bin Laden.

00:12:51.519 --> 00:12:55.206
He hated American politics
and American religion

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.679
and American culture,

00:12:56.703 --> 00:12:59.509
but he had no objection
to American dollars.

00:12:59.533 --> 00:13:01.628
He was quite fond of them, actually.